hadiths[19]{hadithnumber,text}:
"892","Al-Bara' ibn 'Azib related that the Prophet"
"893","Abu Dharr is reported as saying"
"894","Ibn 'Abbas reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"895","Ibn 'Abbas told Shahr (ibn Hawshab)"
"896","Anas reported that the Prophet"
"897","outrage and cutting off\nrelatives."
"898","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"899","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"900","'Mankind!\nWe created you from a male and a female"
"901","Ibn 'Abbas said"
"902","'A'isha said"
"903","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"904","Abu Hurayra said"
"905","'Ali said"
"906","Usayd ibn Abi Usayd reported that his mother said"
"907","'Abdullah ibn Mughaffal al-Muzani said"
"908","Abu Hurayra said"
"909","Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani said"
"910","'When they saw it as a storm cloud advancing on their valleys...'\n(46:24)"
